{"timestamp": 1779377729.594374, "event_type": "body_reported", "tick": 6, "data": {"caller": "player_0", "reason": "Alice reported a dead body", "bodies": [{"room": "upper_engine", "victim_name": "Charlie"}]}}
{"timestamp": 1779377729.594975, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 6, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779377740.861103, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 6, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "Body is in upper engine. I had just walked in from medbay to do my engine task and saw Charlie dead. Frank came in from lower engine right as I found it, so I reported it immediately. Frank, did you pass anyone on your way up, or see anyone run towards oxygen? The killer must have just left."}}
{"timestamp": 1779377760.361195, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 6, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I started in security and went to weapons. I saw Bob in security with me around ticks 2, 3, and 4, so he was on the right side for a good chunk of the round. I didn\u2019t see Charlie at all, and I didn\u2019t see Alice or Frank until this meeting. I\u2019m in weapons now and saw nobody there.\n\nIf the body was in upper engine, that\u2019s pretty far from where Bob and I were, so Bob looks relatively okay to me for now. I agree we need to hear from Frank on whether he saw anyone between lower and upper engine, and Eve\u2019s route too."}}
{"timestamp": 1779377777.312164, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 6, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I started weapons and went straight to security for my task. I was in security with Diana around ticks 2 and 3, and then I saw Diana leave security toward weapons at tick 4. I didn\u2019t see Charlie at all, and I didn\u2019t see anyone coming from the left side.\n\nSo from my POV, Diana\u2019s story checks out, and we were both on the right side pretty far from upper engine. I think the key info is from Frank and Eve \u2014 especially Frank since Alice says he came up from lower engine right as the body was found. Did Frank see anyone in lower engine or moving toward oxygen/upper engine?"}}
{"timestamp": 1779377804.678025, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 6, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I started upper engine, then went to oxygen. Important: Charlie was alive with me in upper engine for a while \u2014 I saw Charlie enter upper engine from oxygen at tick 1, and I saw him there ticks 2, 3, and 4. After that I left to oxygen to do my O2 task, and I didn\u2019t see anyone else in oxygen.\n\nSo the kill has to be very fresh, after tick 4. Since Alice found the body in upper engine and Frank came from lower engine right then, I think the main info has to be from Frank now. From my POV Bob and Diana being right side sounds consistent, and this likely narrows to whoever was around upper/lower/medbay right after I left. Alice could be report, Frank could have passed the killer or be involved \u2014 I want to hear Frank\u2019s exact route."}}
{"timestamp": 1779377829.024288, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 6, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I started in lower engine and went up toward upper engine. I didn\u2019t see anyone in lower engine, and I didn\u2019t pass anyone coming down or going toward oxygen. When I got into upper engine, Alice was there and Charlie\u2019s body was there, and the report happened basically immediately.\n\nSo from my side: if the killer left through lower engine, I should\u2019ve seen them, and I didn\u2019t. Bob and Diana seem to confirm each other on the right side, so I\u2019m not looking there much. That leaves Alice, Eve, and me from everyone\u2019s POV.\n\nEve says Charlie was alive in upper engine until tick 4, then she left to oxygen. The body being found right after makes Eve the last confirmed person with Charlie alive. Alice could be a self-report, but her story of coming from medbay lines up with me arriving from lower at the same time. I\u2019m most suspicious of Eve here, but I can understand if people think it\u2019s between Eve and Alice."}}
{"timestamp": 1779377845.7377589, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 6, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "Frank is absolutely right, and his logic just sealed it for me. Let's look at the timeline here: Eve openly admits she was alone with Charlie in upper engine until tick 4. I walked in right after from medbay and found him dead, with Frank arriving from lower engine at the exact same time. \n\nFrank confirmed no one fled through lower engine. And Eve, if a killer had struck after you left and fled toward oxygen, you would have bumped right into them. The only explanation that fits the physical evidence is that Eve killed Charlie right before \"leaving\" to oxygen. \n\nBob and Diana are cleared on the right side. The timeline points exactly to Eve. I'm voting Eve.\n\nEve"}}
{"timestamp": 1779377871.2956312, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 6, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I still stand by my earlier info: Bob and I were on the right side together in security for multiple ticks, then I went weapons. I don\u2019t think Bob could be involved in an upper engine kill, and he can vouch for me too.\n\nFor the left side, the timeline sounds really tight. Eve says Charlie was alive in upper engine until tick 4, then she left to oxygen. Alice reports finding the body in upper engine right after, and Frank says he came from lower engine and saw no one pass. If Frank is telling the truth, that makes it hard for someone to have killed and escaped down. If Alice is telling the truth, she found it coming from medbay.\n\nSo to me this is mostly Eve vs Alice, with Frank slightly less suspicious because both Alice and Frank place him arriving as the report happened. Eve being the last confirmed with Charlie alive is the strongest evidence we have. I\u2019m leaning Eve here."}}
{"timestamp": 1779377899.200856, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 6, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "From my side, nothing changes: I was right side the whole round \u2014 weapons to security \u2014 and Diana was with me in security ticks 2 and 3, then I saw her leave toward weapons tick 4. So I\u2019m comfortable clearing Diana for this kill, and I know I wasn\u2019t near upper engine.\n\nFor the left side, the tight part is Eve saying Charlie was alive in upper engine until tick 4, then Alice finds him dead almost immediately after, with Frank arriving from lower and saying nobody passed him. If Frank didn\u2019t see anyone leave down, and Eve didn\u2019t see anyone in oxygen, then Eve being the last person alone with Charlie is the cleanest fit.\n\nI don\u2019t think this fully hard-clears Alice or Frank, but with the info we have, Eve is the strongest vote to me."}}
{"timestamp": 1779377928.3517609, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 6, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I need to push back hard on Alice\u2019s logic because it\u2019s skipping the obvious route: I would only \u201cbump into\u201d a killer if they ran to oxygen. I would NOT see someone coming from or leaving through medbay, and Alice herself says she came from medbay into upper engine.\n\nMy actual info is: Charlie was alive with me in upper engine through tick 4, then I left to oxygen. I did not see anyone in oxygen after that. Frank says nobody went through lower engine. That means the medbay side is the big unchecked route, and Alice is the one claiming to come from medbay and instantly finding/reporting.\n\nYes, I was last with Charlie alive, but that does not mean I killed him. The kill window is after I left, and Alice had direct access from medbay with no one vouching her. Frank\u2019s info actually makes Alice look worse to me, not better, because lower was covered and oxygen was covered by me. I think this is a self-report from Alice."}}
{"timestamp": 1779377973.005452, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 6, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "Eve\u2019s point about medbay being unchecked is fair \u2014 I can\u2019t hard-clear Alice. From what I personally know: I came up from lower engine, saw nobody in lower, and nobody passed me. When I entered upper engine, Alice was there with Charlie\u2019s body and the report happened immediately.\n\nBob and Diana sound safely right side for this kill. That leaves the left-side timeline. Eve was the last person confirmed with Charlie alive in upper engine, and she had a clean exit to oxygen before Alice and I arrived. Alice self-report is possible, but it would mean she came from medbay, killed basically right as I was arriving, and instantly reported \u2014 that\u2019s possible but feels less likely than Eve killing before leaving.\n\nSo I\u2019m voting Eve here. If it\u2019s wrong, Alice should be looked at next."}}
